      "hash64": "9A47009BB4E2CD15",
      "text": "¿Quieres irte a dormir hasta mañana?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_system_02",
      "hash64": "9A46FD9BB4E2C7FC",
      "text": "Al día siguiente...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_student1_01",
      "hash64": "088E136CA2287378",
      "text": "Buenos días, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_student1_02",
      "hash64": "088E166CA2287891",
      "text": "Corin me ha dado un recado para ti: dice que\\nte espera en casa y que vayas allí cuanto antes.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_student1_03",
      "hash64": "088E156CA22876DE",
      "text": "No lo entiendo. Soy su pareja de actividad,\\n¡pero a mí no me invita!\\c\\n¿Se puede saber qué os traéis entre manos?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_student2_01",
      "hash64": "0752CB677B1ADDCF",
      "text": "El encargado nos enseñó unas máscaras de lo\\nmás impresionantes.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_student3_01",
      "hash64": "31D0DF5C31B2501A",
      "text": "¡¿Ya has encontrado todos los carteles?!\\n¡Jolín, qué rapidez!\\c\\nMi compañera no quiere que me maree, así que\\nestamos yendo poco a poco.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0280_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "4E67221DF8A82D5C",
      "text": "Algunos alumnos no han terminado todavía\\nla actividad de orientación.\\c\\nMientras esperas, aprovecha y explora a placer\\nla comarca de Noroteo.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
